  moveOrHold: "Move (edit or sequence) where a line describes an action or a turn: the hug and hide, the fort, the whiteboard throw, the phone pull, the closing door, the weight lifted, Every/Single/Week, the broken mug, the frozen spill, the dimming spotlight, the spiky hug, the softening spikes, the jar opened. Hold or simply cut on statements, lists and hurts: the list lines (Not drugs…, Who did it?…, the four scared questions, KEVIN, the double standards, the hidden things, 'I see you…') are one image per line, and the hurt lines (This one hurts, Eventually they stop, I need to know, is a quiet question) are held still.",
